{
  "comment": "The sculpt MCP surface a generated project actually gets. `tools` is set-equal to the live tools/list response of version 0.2.2 installed from the published npm tarball into a clean directory; that run also served 31 technique-safe grimoire resources. `inputSchemas` and `descriptions` come from that same response. `recommended` is the complete ordered authoring loop documented by every template. Regenerate with `pnpm tsx scripts/capture-asset-mcp-tools.ts`. The recorded surface serves 12 tools.",
